.TH PSLayerFree 3 2023-12-07 "PsyC 0.9.3" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
PSLayerFree

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/psyc.h>

.I
void  
.br
\fBPSLayerFree\fR(\fIPSLayer *layer\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Free memory allocated for \fIlayer\fR and all of its objects (ie. weights, states).
.br

.br
\fBWARN\fR:  this function should be called only for layers not being part of any model, since by freeing models (\fIPSModelFree\fR), all their layers will be automatically freed.
.br

.SH SEE ALSO
PSModelFree(3)
